# Hash-locked MLX-affine reference environment for the Qwen3-VL 8B quantized
# candidate probe (Phase 7.3b WP1, item 5). Opt-in: install it explicitly with
# install.sh; Gradle never installs or imports it.
#
# mlx-vlm 0.3.9 is the newest release in the transformers-4.57 / mlx-0.31.2
# generation: 0.3.4 added Qwen3-VL, 0.3.6 fixed its attention/position ids/mrope,
# 0.3.8 and 0.3.9 fixed further qwen3_vl issues (image-feature/token matching).
# 0.3.10+ require transformers 5 and a newer MLX, which would break alignment
# with the pinned HF reference (transformers 4.57.6) and the native/oracle pins
# (mlx 0.31.2); they are rejected for this probe.
mlx-vlm==0.3.9
mlx==0.31.2
transformers==4.57.6
